Bharata ends and Lakṣmaṇa proposes purifying Aśvamēdha --- Lakṣmaṇa cites Indra cleansed of brahmahatyā by horse rite --- Lakṣmaṇa tells of righteous asura Vr̥tra spanning hundred yōjanas --- Vr̥tra rules whole earth righteously with fruitful harvests --- Vr̥tra entrusts kingdom to son and begins fierce tapas frightening gods --- Distressed Indra tells Viṣṇu Vr̥tra conquered worlds --- Indra warns Vr̥tra will enslave worlds if tapas continues --- Indra pleads Viṣṇu to save gods by slaying Vr̥tra